BrickStorm Privacy Policy

Last Updated: August 3, 2026

Introduction

Welcome to BrickStorm, a puzzle game developed by Weezard Games. We believe privacy should be simple and transparent. This Privacy Policy explains how BrickStorm handles information when you install and play the game.

Local Gameplay Data

BrickStorm stores gameplay information such as progress, high scores, completed levels, achievements, audio settings, and preferences. This information is primarily kept on your device to improve your gaming experience.

Advertising

BrickStorm may display advertisements supplied by trusted advertising providers, including Google AdMob. These partners may process limited technical information, such as advertising identifiers, to provide and measure relevant advertisements under their own privacy practices.

Technical Diagnostics

Anonymous crash reports, device performance metrics, and gameplay statistics may be collected to identify bugs, improve stability, optimize performance, and enhance future updates. These reports are not intended to personally identify players.

Security

We use reasonable administrative and technical safeguards to help protect information associated with BrickStorm. Although no digital service can guarantee absolute security, we continually improve our protection measures.

Children

BrickStorm is intended for a broad audience. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has submitted personal information, please contact Weezard Games so appropriate action can be taken.

Future Online Features

Future releases may include optional online functionality such as cloud saves, leaderboards, tournaments, seasonal events, or account synchronization. If these features require additional information, this Privacy Policy will be updated before they become available.

Your Rights and Choices

You may stop using BrickStorm at any time by uninstalling the application. Where supported, you may also manage advertising preferences through your device or Google account settings.

Changes to this Policy

As BrickStorm evolves, this Privacy Policy may be updated to reflect new features, legal obligations, or service improvements. The latest version will always include the current revision date.

Contact

If you have questions, feedback, or privacy-related requests regarding BrickStorm, please contact Weezard Games using the official support information provided on the Google Play Store listing or within the application where available.

Commitment to Players

Weezard Games is committed to maintaining a safe, enjoyable, and trustworthy experience for every BrickStorm player. Thank you for choosing BrickStorm.
